{
  "product": {
    "id": 9080060805374,
    "title": "Mist by SkullSaints: Ryzen 3 4300U, DDR4 Dual-Channel, PCIe NVMe SSD, USB 3.2 Gen2, USB-C DP/PD, 2.5Gbps LAN, Wi-Fi 6, BT 5.3, 4K Dual Display Mini PC",
    "body_html": "<!-- \ud83d\udd25 SkullSaints Mist Mini PC | Card-style Spec Sheet for Shopify -->\n<div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border-radius: 14px; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); font-family: 'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #111827;\">\ud83d\udd25 SkullSaints <span style=\"color: #b91c1c;\">Mist (4300U)</span> Mini PC</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0; color: #6b7280;\">AMD Ryzen\u2122 3 4300U \u2022 Radeon Graphics \u2022 Dual M.2 Storage \u2022 Type-C DP + Charging</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr)); gap: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #dc2626; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Processor (CPU)</strong><br>AMD Ryzen\u2122 3 4300U (4C / 4T, 2.7 \u2013 3.7 GHz, 15W)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Graphics (GPU)</strong><br>AMD Radeon\u2122 Graphics (up to 1400 MHz)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #fb923c; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Memory (RAM)</strong><br>Dual DDR4-3200 SO-DIMM \u2014 up to 32 GB</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f97316; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Storage (SSD)</strong><br>Dual Slots<br>M.2 2280 NVMe/SATA (up to 4 TB)<br>M.2 2242 NVMe/SATA (up to 2 TB)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0ea5e9; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Wireless Connectivity</strong><br>Wi-Fi 6 (RTL9851), Bluetooth 5.3</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Network Port</strong><br>1 \u00d7 RJ45 (2.5 Gbps / 1 Gbps / 100 Mbps)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #14b8a6; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Type-C Port</strong><br>Type-C (DP + Data + PD Charging)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Display Outputs</strong><br>2 \u00d7 HDMI 2.0 (4K @ 60 Hz) + Type-C DP</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>USB Ports</strong><br>3 \u00d7 USB 3.2 Gen2 (10 Gbps), 1 \u00d7 USB 2.0</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #84cc16; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Audio Jack</strong><br>3.5 mm Combo (CTIA Standard)</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #facc15; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Material</strong><br>ABS Plastic</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Cooling System</strong><br>Active Fan Cooling</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #eab308; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Operating System</strong><br>Windows 11 Pro</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #c084fc; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Dimensions (mm)</strong><br>115 \u00d7 106 \u00d7 37, 330 grams</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #a855f7; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Power Supply</strong><br>DC 12V / 3A</div>\n<div style=\"background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 8px;\">\n<strong>Reason to Buy</strong><br><span style=\"color: #16a34a; font-weight: 600;\">\ud83d\udcbb Ultra-Compact \u2022 Wi-Fi 6 \u2022 2.5G LAN \u2022 Triple Display</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size: 13px; text-align: center; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 20px;\">Specifications may vary depending on configuration and region.</p>\n</div>",
